WEBVTT

00:01.280 --> 00:02.160
Yuanzhi

00:02.240 --> 00:02.800
Here

00:02.880 --> 00:04.240
You go down first

00:04.320 --> 00:05.960
Say that bringing a large army into the city during the day is dangerous

00:06.040 --> 00:07.520
Easy for the Wuzhao to take advantage

00:07.600 --> 00:08.400
Wait until nightfall

00:08.480 --> 00:09.800
Then have someone open the gates

00:09.880 --> 00:11.880
Have the volunteers enter in groups

00:11.960 --> 00:12.280
At the same time

00:12.360 --> 00:13.880
Send them another batch of grain

00:13.960 --> 00:15.480
Don't let them cause trouble

00:15.560 --> 00:15.840
Your subject

00:16.000 --> 00:17.400
Receives orders

00:20.720 --> 00:21.800
After nightfall

00:21.880 --> 00:23.800
You come with me to the volunteer army camp

00:23.880 --> 00:25.280
Yes

00:43.160 --> 00:44.560
Find Liu Dadao's tent

00:55.960 --> 00:57.360
Halt

01:05.440 --> 01:06.720
Which family are you two from?

01:06.800 --> 01:08.200
You look unfamiliar

01:11.880 --> 01:13.240
Right now in this area

01:13.320 --> 01:15.000
There are only the three of us

